  "gaps": [
    "Only 18 delivered-to-destination sales exist in the archive; the most recent delivered sale ends in 2015.",
    "The sale price is a total lot value and is not published by species or grade; no allocation is made.",
    "The detail pages do not publish a delivery destination field; the 'Destination :' input is only a Google Maps directions box. Delivery terms are inside the unparsed tender documents; the price point is delivered-to-destination, not a confirmed mill gate.",
    "CS201207001 re-offers 8,300 m3 of unsold CS201206004 timber and SO201207001 re-offers 13,900 m3 of unsold SO201206009 timber. The 22,200 m3 overlap is counted once in the unique offered volume and once in the unique awarded volume; do not sum the naive row totals.",
